{"ref":"BDB, מִשְׁבָּר","hw":"מִשְׁבָּר","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁבָּר</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>breaker</strong>, of sea;—pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁבְּרֵי־יָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 93:4\" href=\"/Psalms.93.4\">ψ 93:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קֹלוֹת מַיִם רַבִּים</span>; in comp. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s majesty); fig. of calamities, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁבְּרֵי־מָוֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.5\">2 S 22:5</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">חֶבְלֵי־מָוֶת</span> in ‖ <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:5\" href=\"/Psalms.18.5\">ψ 18:5</a>); as sent by <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁבָּרֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:8\" href=\"/Psalms.88.8\">ψ 88:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ וְגַלֶּיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 42:8\" href=\"/Psalms.42.8\">42:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 2:4\" href=\"/Jonah.2.4\">Jon 2:4</a>.—<a data-ref=\"Job 41:17\" href=\"/Job.41.17\">Jb 41:17</a> v. i. <a data-ref=\"BDB, שֶׁ֫בֶר\" href=\"/BDB,_שֶׁ֫בֶר\", dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁבֶר</a>.","next":"BDB, שֶׁ֫בֶר³","prev":"BDB, מַשְׁבֵּר²"}